% 10-FILES: NESTED LOAD, LIST, AND FILES WRITTEN AND READ WITH WOPEN, PUT,
% OPEN AND GET ON CHANNEL 3 (RKERNEL LOAD ... PUT).  THIS FILE IS LOAD
% LEVEL 1, ON CHANNEL 1; CHANNELS 1-3 ARE THE SEQUENTIAL ONES (RMS.MAR
% FAB1-3), AND 5 IS KEYED, SO PUT THERE FAILS WITH RMS-W-RAC.
DECIMAL
'10A.STO LOAD
"AFTER NEST" MSG CR
'T1.TMP 3 WOPEN
"LINE ONE" COUNT 3 PUT
"LINE TWO!" COUNT 3 PUT
3 CLOSE
'T1.TMP 3 OPEN
"GET     " MSG BUF 2+ 100 3 GET = = CR
"GET 2   " MSG BUF 2+ 100 3 GET = = CR
"GET EOF " MSG BUF 2+ 100 3 GET = CR
3 CLOSE
"LIST" MSG CR
'T1.TMP LIST
"AFTER LIST" MSG CR
'10D.STO LOAD
"NOT REACHED IN 10-FILES" MSG CR
